<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <PackageId>ZXUI.Svg.Core</PackageId>
    <Product>ZXUI Svg Core</Product>
    <Title>ZXUI.Svg.Core</Title>
    <Version>1.0.2</Version>
    <Description>Core SVG parsing and rendering for ZXUI.Svg. Pure .NET library — only dependency is SkiaSharp. Loads SVG files (path / polyline / polygon / line + viewBox), exposes SkiaSharp SKPicture / SKPath, and renders to PNG bytes / files / SKCanvas. Use directly in console / server / Unity apps, or pair with a UI binding (ZXUI.Svg.Avalonia for Avalonia). Target framework: net10.0.</Description>
    <PackageTags>avalonia;svg;icon;zxui;vector;skia;skiarpash;core</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReleaseNotes><![CDATA[
1.0.2 ——
- 包内附带 README.md（修复 nuget.org 上的 "Readme missing" 警告，README 路径指向仓库根目录）。

1.0.1 ——
- 新增 <path d="..."> 解析支持：path mini-language（M / L / H / V / C / S / Q / T / A / Z）交给 SkiaSharp 原生 SKPath.ParseSvgPathData 解析。
  此前只解析 polyline / polygon / line，导致以 <path> 为主体的图标（feather-save、feather-download 等）只画出局部线条、主体缺失。

首发版 —— 纯 .NET SVG 核心库（ZXUI.Svg 拆分出来的底层）。

提供：
- SvgDocument：SVG 文档（viewBox + SkiaSharp SKPicture）
- 加载：Load(path) / Load(stream) / Load(XDocument)
- 渲染：RenderToPngBytes(w, h, background?) / SavePng(path, w, h) / DrawToCanvas(canvas, w, h, paint?)
- 输出 SkiaSharp 原生类型：SKPicture / SKPath / SKColor

支持 SVG 子集：path / polyline / polygon / line + viewBox。

零 UI 框架依赖 —— 只依赖 SkiaSharp。Console / 服务器 / Unity 等任意 .NET 项目都能用。
    ]]></PackageReleaseNotes>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="SkiaSharp" Version="2.88.*" />
    <PackageReference Include="SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux" Version="2.88.*" />
    <PackageReference Include="SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.macOS" Version="2.88.*" />
    <PackageReference Include="SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Win32" Version="2.88.*" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)/../README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="README.md" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
